        "headingText": "\r\n<p>8200/3 Thymic carcinoma with adenoid cystic carcinoma&ndash;like features</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-10-27T09:52:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 477,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "ICD-11 coding",
    "headingPosition": 3,
    "headingid": 434,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68251,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 434,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>2C27.0 &amp; XH92Y9 Carcinoma of thymus &amp; Thymic carcinoma with adenoid cystic carcinoma&ndash;like features</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-10-27T09:52:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 478,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Related terminology",
    "headingPosition": 4,
    "headingid": 435,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68252,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 435,
        "headingText": "<p><em>Not recommended:</em> adenoid cystic carcinoma&ndash;like tumour; adenoid cystic carcinoma of the thymus.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-12-01T17:09:37"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 479,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 436,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68253,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 436,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-10-27T09:52:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 480,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 437,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68254,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 437,
        "headingText": "<p>Thymic carcinoma with adenoid cystic carcinoma&ndash;like features is localized in the anterior (prevascular) mediastinum.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2021-01-04T11:39:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 481,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 438,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68255,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 438,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Patients are usually asymptomatic. In one case, multiple bone and pulmonary metastases were found {22572229}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-10-27T09:52:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 482,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 439,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68256,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 439,
        "headingText": "<p>This is a very rare tumour, with &lt;&nbsp;10&nbsp;cases reported in the literature {27941539}. The patients&rsquo; ages ranged from 47 to 77&nbsp;years. Male patients predominate.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2021-01-20T11:31:21"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 483,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 440,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68257,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 440,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-10-27T09:52:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 484,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 441,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68258,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 441,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Comparative genomic hybridization revealed an isolated gain of chromosome&nbsp;8 in one single case {17667537}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-10-27T09:52:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 491,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 448,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68259,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 448,
        "headingText": "<p>The tumours are solid to solid-microcystic, mostly with pushing margins, rarely infiltrative, and 40&ndash;130 mm in diameter, with haemorrhagic areas {17667537}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2021-02-03T11:09:52"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 485,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 442,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68260,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 442,
        "headingText": "<p>The tumour shows marked histological similarities to adenoid cystic carcinoma {27941539; 17667537; 22572229}. It consists of nests of basaloid cells arranged in a cribriform pattern, with the microcysts containing mucoid matrix (basement membrane&ndash;like, mucicarmine-positive, and collagen&nbsp;IV&ndash;positive) and formed by two cell rows. Intracellular mucin is not found. Nuclear atypia is slight to moderate, and mitotic activity is minimal. Unlike in adenoid cystic carcinoma, true glands, containing PAS-positive, diastase-resistant material, are rarely seen within the basaloid islands. Tumour necrosis and vascular invasion are occasionally present.</p>\r\n<h5>Immunohistochemistry</h5>\r\n<p>The tumour shows positivity for p63, high-molecular-weight cytokeratin, pancytokeratin, CK19, and CK5/6; there are scattered CD5-positive cells and scattered S100-positive cells {17667537; 26194601}. Unlike in adenoid cystic carcinoma, KIT (CD117) is negative, and myoepithelial markers (e.g. SMA) are negative. Neuroendocrine markers are negative {22572229}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2020-12-01T17:10:00"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 486,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 443,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68261,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 443,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not available</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-10-27T09:52:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 487,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 444,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68262,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 444,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2020-10-27T09:52:18"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 490,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 447,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68263,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 447,
        "headingText": "<p><em>Essential:</em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Thymic carcinoma morphologically similar to adenoid cystic carcinoma, but generally lacking true glands within the cribriform-basaloid islands</li>\r\n<li>Exclusion of metastasis from salivary gland, lung, or breast</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><em>Desirable:</em></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Immunohistochemistry positive for pancytokeratins, CK5/6, p63/p40</li>\r\n<li>Negative staining for SMA, KIT (CD117)</li>\r\n</ul>",
        "timestamp": "2021-02-22T16:58:22"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 488,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 445,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68264,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 445,
        "headingText": "<p>Tumours should be staged according to the TNM system [[Brierley JD, Gospodarowicz MK, Wittekind C, editors. TNM classification of malignant tumours. 8th ed. Oxford (UK): Wiley-Blackwell; 2017.]] {25396314} and, optionally, the Masaoka&ndash;Koga system {21847052}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2021-01-14T11:04:16"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 489,
    "bookid": 35,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 446,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 68265,
        "bookId": 35,
        "chapterId": 239,
        "headingId": 446,
        "headingText": "<p>In the few reported cases, the disease followed an indolent course (follow-up of &lt;&nbsp;3&nbsp;years) {27941539}. However, one patient had Masaoka&ndash;Koga stage&nbsp;III disease {20868782} and one patient showed distant metastases {22572229}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2021-02-22T16:58:35"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]